finding_9 = "TestRepair_68_FollowRefusalsDecodeInSDK: real sqlc follow adapter and HTTP into the SDK shared generated Go schema validator and Error consumer; every input refusal and restricted-authority read/mutation refusal preserves the complete correlated Error."
